00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
They don't know how
to tell their story.

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:51.651
-Well, it's very nice that
you're telling their story

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:52.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so glad you added
that to the book,

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:54.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
and thank you so much
for being here.

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:55.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, a pleasure to be here
-It's always a pleasure.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:57.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Michael Lewis, everybody.

